e=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 11 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> 1 abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido<\/div><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Cart\u00e3o de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua e telem\u00f3vel operacional<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/01 a 07\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/02 a 27\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando, onde e a que horas se realiza o Ma\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Ma\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partidas faseadas junto \u00e0s Piscinas Cobertas Municipais de Ma\u00e7\u00e3o (Santar\u00e9m): Trail Longo (25 km) \u00e0s 08:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:15), Trail Curto (17 km) \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45), Mini Trail (11 km) \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15) e Caminhada (11 km) \u00e0s 09:35 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Ma\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases: Fase 1 (at\u00e9 7 de janeiro de 2027) \u2014 16,00 \u20ac (25 km), 14,00 \u20ac (17 km), 12,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 11 km) e 10,00 \u20ac (Caminhada); Fase 2 (8 de janeiro a 7 de fevereiro) \u2014 18,00 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac, 14,00 \u20ac e 11,00 \u20ac; Fase 3 (8 a 27 de fevereiro) \u2014 20,00 \u20ac, 18,00 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac. Os residentes com domic\u00edlio fiscal no concelho de Ma\u00e7\u00e3o usufruem de um desconto de 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona nas Piscinas Cobertas Municipais de Ma\u00e7\u00e3o (junto ao Agrupamento de Escolas Verde Horizonte) no s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, das 16:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, a partir das 07:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal personalizado com chip (nas provas competitivas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, medalha de finisher, banhos quentes e refei\u00e7\u00e3o (almo\u00e7o) no final da prova. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio portar cart\u00e3o de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, telem\u00f3vel operacional, dorsal vis\u00edvel e manta t\u00e9rmica (obrigat\u00f3ria nos 25 km e 17 km; recomendada nos 11 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite (cut-off) e a entidade organizadora?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os tempos m\u00e1ximos de conclus\u00e3o s\u00e3o de 5 horas para o Trail Longo (25 km), 4 horas para o Trail Curto (17 km) e 3 horas para o Mini Trail (11 km). A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Ma\u00e7\u00e3o, Penhascoso e Aboboreira, sendo certificada pela ATRP e integrada no Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ma\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Piscinas Cobertas Municipais de Ma\u00e7\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ma\u00e7\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Ma\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027 realiza-se a 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 em Ma\u00e7\u00e3o, Santar\u00e9m. Inclui Trail 25 km, 17 km, 11 km e Caminhada. Consulta o regulamento e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-macao-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 25 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/